                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='24'>Ethical Consideration</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Secondary Data Use:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14'> The analysis uses secondary data collected from Victoria Police and hospital reports, requiring no additional consent from individuals involved.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Data Anonymization: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14'>Ensured that all personal identifiers have been removed to protect the privacy of individuals represented in the crash and injury reports.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Data Ownership and Public Access: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14'>The data is owned by Victoria Police and hospitals, and is made available for public use, adhering to legal and ethical standards.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Bias Mitigation: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14'>Efforts have been made to avoid bias in data collection, analysis, and interpretation. This includes the balanced representation of various crash types and road user demographics.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Transparency and Reproducibility:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14'> The process of data consolidation, validation, and enrichment is documented to ensure that the analysis can be transparently reviewed and reproduced by others.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14' italic='true'>Integrity and Accuracy:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='14'> Data validation and enrichment processes were rigorously applied to ensure high accuracy and reliability of insights into road safety trends in Victoria.</run>
