    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Recommendations'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='3' type-v2='text' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontsize='24'>Recommendations</run>
              <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='14'>1. Focus on regions with high accident rates, such as Metropolitan South East, for infrastructure improvements (TAC, n.d.).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='14'>2. Conduct public awareness programs (TAC, n.d.).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='14'>3. Promote defensive driving courses and vehicle safety checks (VicRoads, 2021).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='14'>4. Evaluate and improve road designs and safety barriers in accident-prone areas (VicRoads, 2021).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='14'>5. Adjust emergency response and traffic management strategies to match higher accident times and days, especially during late afternoon and evening hours (TAC, n.d.).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='14'>6. Time-targeted Interventions: Implement specific time-targeted interventions such as increased traffic monitoring and speed control (TAC, n.d.).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='14'>7. Implement stricter speed enforcement in higher speed zones where accidents are more severe (TAC, n.d.).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='14'>8. Encourage the use of speed-limiting technologies in vehicles traveling in higher speed zones (TAC, n.d.).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='14'>9. Enhance DUI checkpoints during hours where alcohol-related accidents peak (VicRoads, 2021).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='42' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='98000' id='41' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98400' x='800' y='1000'>
